=== base ===
# Catering Agreement

This Agreement is made between Fennick Food Services Ltd (the "Caterer") and Stourleigh College (the "College").

## 3. Service
3.1 The Caterer shall provide hot lunches on every teaching day.
3.2 The Caterer shall display allergen information for each dish.
=== amendment ===
# Variation Letter

This Variation is made on 1 June 2027 between Fennick Food Services Ltd (the "Caterer") and Stourleigh College (the "College").

1. The following new clause 8.10 is inserted after clause 8.9: "8.10 The Caterer shall offer a vegan option at every service."
